"char_code": "88typeMod", "voice_key": "DIALOGUEWEDDING", "caption": "Thank you... No, I'm not just being polite. I can't help but express my gratitude just looking at you, Master."}, "740711": {"char_code": "88typeMod", "voice_key": "SOULCONTRACT", "caption": "So what would you like this time, Master?<>Huhhh? Me...? A-Alright. But make sure you take good care of me...<>Umm... So this time, I'm yours."}, "740712": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "740713": {"char_code": "88typeMod", "voice_key": "HELLO", "caption": "Welcome! Please try today's special drink."}, "740715": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "740716": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}}}